senses.gloss:
अविकार अ-विकार, अस्, आ, अम्, or अ-विकार्य,
अस्, आ, अम्, immutable, unchangeable; permanent;
(अम्), n. unchangeableness.

अ-विगम, अस्, आ, अम्, unseparated, unremoved;
(अस्), m. non-separation, association, inherence, pre-
sence.

अ-विघ्न, अस्, आ, अम्, uninterrupted, unimpeded;
(अम्), n. undisturbedness, want of obstacle; अवि-
घ्नेन, ind. without obstacle, uninterruptedly.

अ-विपाक, अस्, m. indigestion; immaturity; not
suffering the consequence of actions in a former life;
(अस्, आ, अम्), suffering from indigestion.

अ-विराम, अस्, आ, अम्, uninterrupted, continuous;
(अस्), m. uninterrupted succession, continuance; (अम्),
ind. uninterruptedly.

अविरुद्ध अ-विरुद्ध, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. रुध्),
unobstructed, unimpeded; allowed, permitted, proper;
compatible, consistent with.

आविश् आ-विश्, cl. 6. P. -विशति, -वेष्टुम्, to
go towards, approach; to enter; to take possession of;
to arise; Caus. -वेशयति, -यितुम्, to cause to enter.
